{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the early demo of <i>Galactic Veins</i>!</strong><br>Step aboard your first ship and dive into a guided tutorial designed to teach you the core systems of space exploration, mining, salvaging, and ship management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your vessel's detailed HUD and deep control mechanics as you navigate asteroid fields, harvest rare resources, and break down derelict wrecks for valuable components.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Process materials, unlock new technologies through research, and customize the interior layout of your ship to suit your playstyle. Set up the foundation for automation and manage your production  keep your ship efficient and sustain the hostility of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the environment and venture into the unknown as you chart a mysterious, uncharted galaxy filled with opportunity and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This early demo offers a focused glimpse into the larger vision of <i>Galactic Veins</i>\u2014a rich, systems-driven space game about building, optimizing, and surviving beyond the stars.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3796860?t=1749476163","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796860/08fc0d48dde054836facf153efb7722b7cc6db7d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749476163","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796860/7dc366ac3942d1a112cc52992d48dca6179f4aa4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749476163","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796860/7dc366ac3942d1a112cc52992d48dca6179f4aa4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749476163","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the early demo of <i>Galactic Veins</i>!</strong><br>Step aboard your first ship and dive into a guided tutorial designed to teach you the core systems of space exploration, mining, salvaging, and ship management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your vessel's detailed HUD and deep control mechanics as you navigate asteroid fields, harvest rare resources, and break down derelict wrecks for valuable components.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Process materials, unlock new technologies through research, and customize the interior layout of your ship to suit your playstyle. Set up the foundation for automation and manage your production  keep your ship efficient and sustain the hostility of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the environment and venture into the unknown as you chart a mysterious, uncharted galaxy filled with opportunity and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This early demo offers a focused glimpse into the larger vision of <i>Galactic Veins</i>\u2014a rich, systems-driven space game about building, optimizing, and surviving beyond the stars.</p>","developers":["DST Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3242350","name":"Galactic Veins"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796860/1fd1ca2aea7637b3ce6900bbd77f6dbe06f957e9/header.jpg?t=1749476163","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152849,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152849/movie480.mp4?t=1749476161","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152849/movie_max.mp4?t=1749476161"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152849/94b53ae26070cbe695f4e3cb0bb5e6728ac350c2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749476161","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstati